'''NEO Wanwan's Glory''' (絶・綺羅星ペロ降臨, ''Zetsu・Kiraboshi Pero Kōrin'', '''End・Glittering Star Pero Advent''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] and appears on the 5th, 6th, 19th and 20th days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Dogsville (Merciless)|Wanwan's Glory]]. The first stage yields 1,000,000 XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Rugby Cat (Rare Cat)|Rugby Cat]] - Gridiron Cat.

